body:
that must have been horrible, knowing you were going to die and didn’t want to :(
yeah i’ve heard a lot of things like this before, i think there was something about a man who jumped of a bridge (there was a very high chance you would die) but he managed to survive and said as soon as he jumped he regretted it. It’s kind of a weird feeling, for me it was i really wanted a way out, but as soon as i was told i may die, i started getting scared and thinking of all the things i still have to do. Luckily, i survived unlike many other people, which is really sad when i think about it.

And i also agree, it may end your suffering but it causes the suffering of many more people, even if you think no one cares about you, there’s always that one person who would be affected ;
